 "_projectiles": "What 小满 throws on the 射鹿 board and the boards built on it (games/throws.js; Hanli 2026-10-16: 「投掷类都可以换. 可以多设计一些工具, 特效, 让它更好玩」). `from`: the card that makes it his (cards.json; the card law: only his own things) — none, always his; a level's first `ammo` is the scene's own tool, always his. `mass` (the wind's push is over it), `speed` (× the pull's), `drag` (the air), `half` (where it strikes: a tip that far ahead, 0 its middle), `pierce` (snaps a reed no thicker than that — its `breaks` — at any speed, barely slowed; 99 is a wall), `knock` (snaps them, slowed), `bounce` (skips once off the ground), `ability` one tap in flight: dash (straight on along the line it was loosed on, × `dash`) or burst (lightning, reach `radius`). `tip`: the line while it flies.",
